Portions of the keyword harness — the item schema, the Thai canonicalizer and
the exact-substring matcher — derive from th01-tts-eval
(https://github.com/potsawee/th01-tts-eval), whose 50-item pilot seeded the
keyword set.

No audio is redistributed with this work.
